{"id":"30a8f872911e731f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-theory.md","title":"First-Order Theory","display":"df-first-order-theory — First-Order Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-theory","aliases":["93-df-first-order-theory"],"display":"df-first-order-theory — First-Order Theory","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-theory — First-Order Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is a set candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the first-order sentence set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\\)</span> is the first-order-theory predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In model theory a theory may be any set of sentences; deductive closure is not built into this predicate. The consequence-closed propositional notion remains <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf7108c33537548a\" href=\"?note=cf7108c33537548a\" title=\"93-df-theory\">93-df-theory</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"cf7108c33537548a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"In model theory a theory may be any set of sentences; deductive closure is not built into this predicate. The consequence-closed propositional notion remains [[93-df-theory]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":true}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7be4b80a43cd8c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":